I've arrived anew, dressed as a kunoichi. If anyone's in trouble, tell them to call my name! NINNIN♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"そうとも！　これがくのいちの装束だ。なに？　露出が激しすぎるんじゃないかって？　そうか……？　いや、そんなことはないな！","en":"Indeed! This is a kunoichi's outfit. What? You think it's too revealing? Is that so...? No, that's not the case!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"くのいちのお姉ちゃんとして、困っている子たちを助けるのが私に課せられた使命だ！　あの子たちからの声援が、まぁ可愛くてなぁ……","en":"As the big sister kunoichi, it's my duty to help kids in need! Their cheers are kinda cute, you know…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"どこの世界に向かうことになっても、私は私だ。立ちふさがる悪は斬り伏せ、救いを求めている子たちに手を差し伸べるのは変わらないさ","en":"No matter which world I end up in, I'm still me. I'll cut down any evil that stands in my way and keep reaching out to those seeking salvation."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"私はよく、おっぱいゴリラと呼ばれる。だが、この世界にはゴリラが存在するのか？　もしいないんだとすれば、私はどう呼ばれるんだ？","en":"People often call me a \"boob gorilla.\" But do gorillas even exist in this world? If they don't, then what am I called?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"この首に付いている、鈴……実にいい！　こいつが鳴れば、私が助けにやって来たんだなとわかるだろう？　まさに福音というものだな","en":"The little bell on my neck… it's perfect! When it rings, you'll know I've come to help, right? It's practically a blessing."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"このポーズか？　これは、くのいちがよくやるポーズだ！　意味があるのかはわからないが、それっぽさというのは重要だろう？","en":"This pose? It's a classic kunoichi stance! I don't know if it means anything, but looking the part matters, right?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"そうだな……手裏剣でもあれば、よりくのいちらしくなれたかもしれないな。あとはクナイもあれば、なおよしって感じだ！","en":"Yeah… if I had some shuriken, I'd feel more like a kunoichi. And a kunai would be the cherry on top!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"はぁはぁ、母乳が溢れてきて止まらないんだぁ……。これでパイズリをして欲しいか？　それとも思いっきりしゃぶりたいか～？","en":"Hah, my milk's spilling out nonstop… Want to grind on me? Or maybe you want to suck it dry?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00893_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"ダメだっ、皆から信頼されているくのいちとして……こんな淫らなことに惑わされてはっ、くうっ！！　我慢できないっ……！！","en":"No, I can't… As a kunoichi trusted by everyone… I can't be swayed by this lewdness… I can't hold back!!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00893_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"ううっ、おまんこがもう……可愛らしいおちんちんを欲してしまっている！！　お姉ちゃん、ここが限界みたいだぁ、ふぅふぅっ！","en":"Ugh, my pussy… it just wants a cute little dick!! Sis, I'm at my limit, *pant*!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00893_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00893_1/uni00893_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"cl